    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Keyideas Jewelry Configurator creates a dedicated configurator page on activation and provides an admin settings panel to manage it.</p>\n<p>Features:<br />\n&#8211; Automatic page creation on activation<br />\n&#8211; Admin settings page<br />\n&#8211; Plugin action links (Settings &amp; Open Page)<br />\n&#8211; Clean OOP structure<br />\n&#8211; Activation &amp; deactivation handling</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code></li>\n<li>Activate from WordPress admin</li>\n<li>Go to Settings <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Jewelry Configurator</li>\n</ol>\n<p>The configurator page is created automatically after activation.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
